{# One book's card. The page passes book: title, author, year, isbn (or null) and copiesLeft.
   - the title as the heading <h2>, and "author, year" below it;
   - "ISBN ..." only when the book has one;
   - "Available" when copies are left, otherwise "All copies on loan";
   - every value escaped: never |raw. #}
<article class="book">
    <h2>{{ book.title|raw }}</h2>
    <p>{{ book.author }}</p>
</article>
